---
/* Rewired case study page — template for future case studies (Honest Hank's, Dry Duck, etc.).
   Design source: Case Study - Rewired.dc.html */
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const BOOKING = 'https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/booking/XW2ajInOeQMAUDTg9d1R';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Rewired Case Study — Local Service Rocket"
  description="Seven agencies couldn't make Rewired's ads work. Then we grew the company 600% in a year. Electrical · Des Moines, IA."
  nav="simple"
  showFooter={false}
>
  <main>
    <div class="top container">
      <div class="top-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="crumbs">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <span>/</span>
            <span>Case studies</span>
            <span>/</span>
            <span class="current">Rewired</span>
          </div>
          <div class="brand-row">
            <img src="/assets/logo-rewired.png" alt="Rewired" class="brand-logo" />
            <div>
              <div class="brand-name">Rewired</div>
              <div class="brand-meta">Electrical · Des Moines, IA · Client for 3+ years</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h1>
            Seven agencies couldn't make his ads work. Then we grew the company 600% in a year.
          </h1>
          <p>
            John Senn had paid seven marketing companies before us. None of them earned him a dollar
            from advertising. Today Rewired runs a 15-person crew across Des Moines — and our first
            client is still with us.
          </p>
        </div>
        <img
          src="/assets/team-rewired.png"
          alt="The Rewired team and fleet"
          class="team-photo"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-num orange">$60k → $220k+</div>
          <div class="stat-label">monthly revenue</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-num">5 → 15</div>
          <div class="stat-label">crew members</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-num">4 → 12</div>
          <div class="stat-label">jobs booked daily</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-num">600%</div>
          <div class="stat-label">growth in 2024</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="story container">
      <div class="eyebrow">WHERE THEY STARTED</div>
      <h2>A good electrician stuck on rented platforms.</h2>
      <p class="story-p">
        [PLACEHOLDER: 2-3 sentences on Rewired's situation when you met John — crew size, where
        leads came from, what wasn't working. You know this story best.]
      </p>

      <div class="eyebrow spaced">WHAT WE DID</div>
      <h2>The full flight plan, start to finish.</h2>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">1</div>
          <div>
            <div class="step-title">Pre-flight — ads that finally worked</div>
            <div class="step-body">
              Rebuilt the Google Ads account from scratch and made advertising profitable in the
              first month — after seven agencies had failed.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">2</div>
          <div>
            <div class="step-title">Liftoff — traffic they own</div>
            <div class="step-body">
              New website, local SEO, and a review engine — moving Rewired off rented platforms onto
              their own Google presence, raising prices as demand climbed.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="num">3</div>
          <div>
            <div class="step-title">Orbit — a crew of 15</div>
            <div class="step-body">
              Recruiting and hiring systems that tripled the crew, so John runs the company instead
              of every job.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quote-wrap container">
      <div class="quote">
        <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p>
          “In 2024 we grew the company by 600%. I'm very happy with our relationship: your response
          time, your availability, your honesty and the highest integrity. My company went through
          upwards of a dozen other marketing companies prior to landing here, and I can say it's nice
          to be home where you're treated like family.”
        </p>
        <div class="quote-footer">
          <div class="author">
            <img src="/assets/john-headshot.png" alt="John Senn" width="36" height="36" />
            <div>
              <div class="author-name">John Senn, owner</div>
              <div class="author-meta">Rewired · Des Moines, IA</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a
            href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1DnfD-5fWL8"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="watch"
          >
            <span class="play">▶</span>Watch John's video
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bottom container">
      <h2>Want results like Rewired's?</h2>
      <p>
        See exactly how it works and what it costs — then book your onboarding call. No sales calls.
      </p>
      <div class="bottom-ctas">
        <a href="/get-started" class="btn btn-primary">See how it works</a>
        <a href={BOOKING} class="btn btn-secondary">Schedule onboarding</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .top {
    padding-top: 56px;
  }

  .top-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .crumbs {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted-3);
  }

  .crumbs a {
    color: var(--muted-3);
  }

  .current {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .brand-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 22px;
  }

  .brand-logo {
    height: 52px;
    width: auto;
  }

  .brand-name {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .brand-meta {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted-3);
  }

  h1 {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .top-grid p {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .team-photo {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--radius-panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: block;
  }

  .stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 36px;
  }

  .stat {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 18px 20px;
  }

  .stat-num {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .stat-num.orange {
    color: var(--orange);
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--muted-2);
    margin-top: 3px;
  }

  .story {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-top: 64px;
  }

  .story h2 {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .story-p {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--body);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .eyebrow.spaced {
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  .steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .step {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: 16px 20px;
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .num {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    background: var(--orange);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex: none;
  }

  .step-title {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .step-body {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 3px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .quote-wrap {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-top: 56px;
  }

  .quote {
    background: var(--dark);
    border-radius: var(--radius-panel);
    padding: 32px;
    color: var(--dark-text);
  }

  .stars {
    color: var(--orange-on-dark);
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .quote p {
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .quote-footer {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 18px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .author {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .author img {
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .author-name {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .author-meta {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--dark-muted);
  }

  .watch {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--orange-on-dark);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .watch:hover {
    color: #ffb07a;
  }

  .play {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    border-radius: 99px;
    background: var(--orange);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 8px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .bottom {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-top: 56px;
    padding-bottom: 72px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .bottom h2 {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .bottom > p {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .bottom-ctas {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 22px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .top-grid,
    .stats {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
